{
	title: 'Tool results under their call drop the call link',
	spec: 'In the terminal, a tool result drawn right under its call (or under another result of the same call) shows no #<call block id> link: the position already ties it to the call. A result separated from its call by another block keeps the link. Background bash messages keep the #<call block id> in their header (task v0).',
